### Check first
Open [this component](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/highlights) and its [metrics](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/metrics). Compare waiting/running requests, token throughput and GPU utilization. The configured threshold is **{{threshold}}** in the monitor chart's unit.

### Likely causes
Arrival rate exceeds serving capacity, long generations or a stalled replica.

### Fix
Check replica readiness, constrain excessive request sizes and tune capacity against measured demand.

### Verify
Waiting requests fall below the threshold and latency recovers. If samples are absent, investigate the exporter and Collector: this threshold check cannot establish healthy operation without data.
